PokeLab — License status: PENDING

This repository does not yet have a finalized license.

The project's intended direction is a source-available license (not OSI Open
Source) permitting noncommercial use, modification and distribution while
restricting third-party commercial use — see LICENSING_STRATEGY.md and
ADR-0008 (docs/adr/0008-source-available-commercial-control.md).

Do not treat the absence of a final license as a grant of any rights. Final
license text requires legal review before publication and before this file
is replaced with binding terms.

Third-party dependencies retain their own licenses — see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
